      propertyPath: m_text
      value: As Arthur grew up from a boy, he came to discover a Sword buried deep
        within a stone that no other person could pull, no matter how hard they tried.
        Whoever pulled it from it's stone was said to be the rightful King of England,
        one day Arthur tried pulling it, and succeeded flawlessly, earning his claim
        over England as it's ruler during the dark ages of Medieval Britain.
